      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW HAZELTON (4) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing eighth (25.71) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Rates on top in this line up. MARCO MARCO (1) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by a nose at Shepparton in a handy 25.55 beating I'm Honey. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with three wins from three starts. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. PADDY'S CHARIOT (8) turned in a plain run last time when seventh at this track over 450m behind Happy And Numb (27.01) in a Grade 5. Was a winner the start prior. Has ability and is one of the better chances. MANDOLIN STORM (2) can sneak into the finish.",
